{"id": "16-710-2-6", "zh": "现在按照完成时（parokkhā）等时态的顺序，讲述词形的次第。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-710-7-12", "zh": "“dada、dadū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-710-13-35", "zh": "dadū”：这个形式与“我名叫那罗陀，人们知道我是迦叶（vidū）”等句中的 vidū 一词相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-710-36-43", "zh": "dade、dadittha、dadaṃ、dadimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-710-44-47", "zh": "dadittha、dadire。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-710-48-51", "zh": "dadittho、dadivho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-711-2-12", "zh": "这里的 **dadittho**，与“你曾和我一起欢笑（sañjagghittho）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-711-13-17", "zh": "没有我在身边，你不要消瘦（kisittho）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-711-18-33", "zh": "你不要踩进那片泥沼（akkamittho）”等句中的 sañjagghittho 等形式相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-711-34-40", "zh": "依照这个方法，凡是能找到用例的地方，都应当考察它们的相同之处。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-711-41-44", "zh": "dadaṃ、dadimhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-711-45-46", "zh": "以上是带完成时语尾的词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-712-2-5", "zh": "adadā、adadū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-712-6-9", "zh": "adade、adadattha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-712-10-13", "zh": "adadaṃ、adadamha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-712-14-17", "zh": "adadattha、adadatthuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-712-18-21", "zh": "adadase、adadavhaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-712-22-24", "zh": "adadiṃ、adadamhase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-712-25-39", "zh": "因此也应当采用前面不带 a 的形式，因为可以见到“我们这些没有布施的人（yesaṃ no na dadamhase）”这样的用例。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-712-40-41", "zh": "以上是带未完成过去时（hiyyattanī）语尾的词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-713-2-7", "zh": "adadi、adaduṃ、adadiṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-713-8-11", "zh": "adado、adadittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-713-12-15", "zh": "adadiṃ、adadimhā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-713-16-19", "zh": "adadā、adadū。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-713-20-23", "zh": "adadase、adadivhaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-713-24-27", "zh": "adadaṃ、adadimhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-713-28-29", "zh": "以上是带不定过去时（ajjatanī）语尾的词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-714-2-12", "zh": "“dadissati、dadissanti”等，全部都应当依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-714-13-14", "zh": "以上是带将来时（bhavissantī）语尾的词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-715-2-17", "zh": "“adadissā、dadissā、adadissaṃsu、dadissaṃsu”等，也全部都应当依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-715-18-19", "zh": "以上是带条件式（kālātipatti）语尾的词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-716-2-5", "zh": "另外还有一些带现在时等语尾的词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-716-6-9", "zh": "deti、denti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-716-10-13", "zh": "desi、detha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-716-14-21", "zh": "demi、dammi、dema、damma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-716-22-25", "zh": "detu、dentu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-716-26-29", "zh": "dehi、detha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-716-30-37", "zh": "demi、dammi、dema、damma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-716-38-40", "zh": "为自言（attanopada）的形式不常见。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-716-41-46", "zh": "祈愿式（sattamī）的形式和完成时的形式也不常见。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-716-47-72", "zh": "不过未完成过去时和不定过去时的形式，有些因为出现在圣典中而常见，可以用“adā、adū、ado、adaṃ”等来配列。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-716-73-77", "zh": "圣典里确实可以见到这样的用例：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-716-78-81", "zh": "帝释（purindada）给予了（adā）布施。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-716-82-85", "zh": "帝释啊，如果你要赐给我（ado）恩惠。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-716-86-89", "zh": "我把象施给了（adaṃ）婆罗门们。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-716-90-91", "zh": "他给了（adāsi）这些。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-716-92-95", "zh": "他们给了（adaṃsu）我机会。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-716-96-99", "zh": "那时我施给了（adāsiṃ）婆罗门。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-716-100-110", "zh": "“dassati、dassanti”等，全部都应当依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-716-111-128", "zh": "“adassā、dassā、adassaṃsu、dassaṃsu、dassiṃsu”等，也全部都应当依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-717-2-7", "zh": "同样有 ādadāti、ādadanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-717-8-11", "zh": "ādadāsi、ādadātha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-717-12-15", "zh": "ādadāmi、ādadāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-717-16-25", "zh": "按迦旃延派的说法，还有为自言形式“ādatte”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-717-26-37", "zh": "同样，“ādadātu、ādadeyya”等，全部都应当依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-717-38-43", "zh": "ādetu、ādeyya 等，应当视情况配列。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-717-44-56", "zh": "同样，“dāpeti、ādāpeti”等，也应当视情况配列。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-718-2-4", "zh": "dā 根，表示可鄙地行进。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-718-5-6", "zh": "dāti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-718-7-8", "zh": "suddāti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-718-9-12", "zh": "suddo、suddī。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-718-13-27", "zh": "其中，**suddo**（首陀罗）：因为他 suddāti，所以叫 suddo；意思是，他由于欺压他人等凶残的行为，以及木工等低贱的行业，很快很快地走向可鄙的境地。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-718-28-40", "zh": "因为这里的 su 是表示迅速义的不变词，dā 是表示呵责义的词根，因为它表达可鄙的行进。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-718-41-44", "zh": "首陀罗的妻子叫 suddī。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-719-2-4", "zh": "du 根，表示行走。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-719-5-6", "zh": "davati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-719-7-8", "zh": "dumo（树）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-719-9-19", "zh": "这里，因为它行走（davati），也就是借助根、干、枝、杈、叶、嫩芽、花、果而得到增长、繁茂与广大，所以叫 dumo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-720-2-3", "zh": "de 根，表示清净。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-720-4-6", "zh": "清净就是洁净。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-720-7-8", "zh": "dāyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-720-9-10", "zh": "dāyanaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-720-11-15", "zh": "就像 gāyati、gāyanaṃ 一样。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-720-16-25", "zh": "dāyituṃ、dāyitvā：词根成分 e 被替换为 āya。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-720-26-35", "zh": "“dātuṃ、datvā”也是它的词形。", "confidence": 80}
